{"id":"word:hebrew:H428","type":"word","title":"אֵלֶּה","subtitle":"H428 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"these or those","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אֵלֶּה (H428) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: d.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 747 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אֵלֶּה (ʼêl-leh) means these or those First listed occurrence: 1Chr 1 23."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אֵלֶּה","transliteration":"ʼêl-leh","pronunciation":"ale'-leh","strong":"H428","lemmaId":"hebrew:H428","partOfSpeech":"d","forms":["הָ/אֵ֔לֶּה","אֵ֖לֶּה","אֵ֣לֶּה","הָ/אֵ֖לֶּה","הָ/אֵ֑לֶּה"],"morphs":[["HPdxcp",320],["HTd/Pdxcp",276],["HC/Pdxcp",106],["HR/Pdxcp",36],["HC/R/Pdxcp",9]]},"definitions":{"short":"these or those","usage":"an-(the) other; one sort, so, some, such, them, these (same), they, this, those, thus, which, who(-m).","full":"H428. elleh אֵ֫לֶּה ( Rabb אֵלּוּ , Aramaic אִלֵּין , & compd. with and in , ) pronoun plural masculine & feminine these , in usage the plural of זֶה . a. Gen 2:4 & often: in apposition to a substantive with a pronominal suffix (always without the article) Exod 9:14 (read with Hi. בְּךָ אֵלֶּה for אֶללִֿבְּךָ ) 10:1 אֵלֶּה אֹתֹתַי these my signs, 11:8 ; Deut 11:18 ; 1Kin 8:59 ; 10:8 ; 22:23 ; 2Kin 1:13 ; Jer 31:21 ; Ezra 2:65 ; Neh 6:14 ; in the Genitive 2Kin 6:20 ; Isa 47:9 ; Deut 18:12 ; Psa 15:5 ; and after כל Gen 14:3 + often Standing alone in a neuter sense, these things (rare in best prose, & not very common in poetry), with עָשָׂה Deut 18:12 ; 22:5 ; 25:16 ; 2Sam 23:17 , 22 ; Psa 15:5 +; with other verbs Ezra 9:1 ; Isa 44:21 ; 47:7 ; Jer 13:22 ; Hosea 14:10; Psa 42:5 ; 50:21 ; 107:43 ; Job 8:2 ; with אֶתֿ Num 15:13 ; Isa 48:14 ; with כָּלֿ Judg 13:23 ; Isa 66:2 +; see also some of the cases with prepositions below d. אלה may point indifferently to what follows, Gen 6:9 ; 10:1 ; 25:7 , 12 , 13 ; Psa 42:5 ; or to what has preceded, Gen 9:19 ; 10:20 , 31 , 32 ; 25:4 ; Lev 21:14 ; 22:22 ; Psa 15:5 ; = such as these ( τοιαῦτα ), 73:12 ; Job 18:21 . b. repeated , אלהו֗֗֗אלה , these . . . those Deut 27:13 ; Josh 8:22 ; Isa 49:12 (3 t.) Psa 20:8 +. c. with the art . (but only after a substantive determined likewise by the article) הָאֵלֶּה Gen 15:1 +?**in Josh 17:9 הָאֵלֶּה עָרִים , read הֶעָרִים , compare 17:12 ; 19:8 ; 19:16 ; 19:31 ; 19:48 , etc. d. with prepositions: בְּאֵלֶּה Lev 25:54 ; 26:23 ; 1Kin 22:11 (7 t.), בָּאֵלֶּה 1Sam 16:10 ; 17:39 ; לְאֵלֶּה Lev 11:24 (4 t), לָאֵלֶּה 1Kin 22:17 (5 t.); מֵאֵלֶּה Gen 9:19 (16 t.); אֵלֶּה עַד Lev 26:18 ; עַלאֵֿלֶּה on account of these things Isa 57:6 ; 64:11 ; Jer 5:9 and elsewhere; כְּאֵלֶּה Job 16:2 ; Jer 10:16 = 51:19 , כָּאֵלֶּה Gen 27:46 ; Lev 10:19 (things like these, so Isa 66:8 ; Jer 18:13 ) Num 28:24 P (compare Ezek 45:25 ) 2Kin 25:17 = Jer 52:22 , כְּמוֺאֵֿלֶּה Job 12:3 .","rootNote":"prolonged from 411 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 1 23","keyReferences":["1Chr 1 23","1Chr 1 29","1Chr 1 31","1Chr 1 33","1Chr 1 43","1Chr 1 54","1Chr 2 1","1Chr 2 18"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":747,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 1 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֖לֶּה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HPdxcp"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 29","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֖לֶּה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HPdxcp"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 31","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֥לֶּה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HPdxcp"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 33","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֖לֶּה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HPdxcp"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 43","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":43,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אֵ֣לֶּה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Pdxcp"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 54","b